   "SELECT order_id,event_id,updated_at,net_amount,ROW_NUMBER() OVER(PARTITION BY order_id ORDER BY updated_at DESC,event_id DESC) AS rn FROM source_order_events ORDER BY order_id,rn;",
   "One order has a timestamp tie. The larger event_id must win even though its amount is not a MAX rule.",
