   ["Inspect incremental_steps, the fixed as_of clock and event arrival/version times.","In Sandbox reset, run batch 1, batch 2, replay it, then run batch 3.","Observe row counts and which event wins each key; compare before/after replay.","Rank available events, FULL JOIN Target and add duplicated key-group count."],
